.DS_Store
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.png
*.pdf
# Internal working notes only. The blanket `*.md` rule that used to live here
# kept README/CONTRIBUTING/SECURITY out of the repo too; see commit history.
HISTORY-PLAN.md
SENSOR-OUTREACH.md
# Documents are never committed here. The methodology reference lives in the
# repo as DATA-METHODOLOGY.md; working documents (Word, Pages, slides) stay
# local and are published, if at all, through their own channels. The .docx
# build of the methodology was tracked until 2026-09-04 and has been purged
# from history — do not re-add it or any other document artefact.
*.docx
*.doc
*.odt
*.rtf
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.pages
*.numbers
*.key
# Word/Office lock files (~$name.docx) appear whenever a document is open.
~$*
node_modules/
.vercel/
.vercel
.wrangler/
.claude/
# local-only wrangler config with real D1 id (see D1-SETUP.md)
wrangler.local.toml

# Site favicons are real deliverables, not working images — the blanket *.png
# rule above would otherwise keep them out of the repo while wrangler still
# deploys them from public/, so the tree would not rebuild the live site.
!public/favicon.ico
!public/favicon-16x16.png
!public/favicon-32x32.png
!public/apple-touch-icon.png
!public/icon-192.png
!public/icon-512.png
__pycache__/
previews/README.md
previews/SECURITY-REVIEW.md
